OL,4,G1800FOpera on 3: Gustave Charpentier's
OL,5,     FLouise
OL,6,     GGustave Charpentier's Louise, a
OL,7,     Ghit opera from the first half of
OL,8,     Gthe twentieth century starring
OL,9,     GElsa Dreisig as the seamstress,
OL,10,     GLouise.
OL,11,G2130FMusic Planet
OL,12,     GKathryn Tickell curates a
OL,13,     Gdazzling selection of roots-based
OL,14,     Gmusic for the festive season. And
OL,15,     GDevonshire folk-singer Jim
OL,16,     GCausley selects a triptych of
OL,17,     Gseasonal Wassails.
